<title>CHINA: Magnificent Est year net down 11.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Magnificent Est year net down 11.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 1.86   vs 2.10 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  41.81  vs 47.27</p>
<p>    Turnover		   128.47 vs 147.15</p>
<p>    Company name	     Magnificent Estates Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		September 22-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Magnificent Estates is involved in property development, hotel and serviced apartment ownership and management, share dealing and loan financing.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted to take into account the bonus issue of one-for-20 shares made during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
